---
import SiteFrame from "../components/SiteFrame.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
import { DONATION_STATUS, GITHUB_URL } from "../site";
---
<SiteFrame title="Support — RepositoryZero" description="Contribute source evidence, review, documentation and future funding to RepositoryZero."><section class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">HELP BUILD THE OPEN CORE</span><h1>Good tools deserve<br /><span>a useful place to connect.</span></h1><p>Help improve the foundation with a concrete use case, a source-backed correction, a test or a focused contribution.</p></section><div class="support-grid"><article class="note-panel"><span class="tiny-label">CONTRIBUTE</span><h2>Start with a useful piece.</h2><p>Read the plan, explain what already exists and show the difference your contribution makes. Public website login and automated submissions are planned; they are not active on this static preview.</p><Button href={GITHUB_URL} external>Open the repository </Button></article><article class="note-panel donation-panel"><span class="tag">{DONATION_STATUS}</span><h2>Donations</h2><p>A donation recipient and hosted payment link have not been configured. No payment is collected here.</p><button class="button button--secondary" type="button" disabled>Donation setup pending</button><p class="small-copy">A future funding policy will use available funds and explicit budget caps. Donations will not buy integration approval or change quality gates.</p></article></div></SiteFrame>
